    "(delivery and intraday, NSE/BSE, through Zerodha; he does NOT trade "
    "F&O). He keeps an accounts workbook that computes every charge, and a "
    "dashboard built around the NSE closing auction. For EACH numbered "
    "headline write one line: '<number>|YES|<TOPIC>|<what changes, and from "
